        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          Ask where to buy a treadmill cheap and most answers give you a list of shops. The more
          useful answer is a ranking, because the places that sell the lowest sticker prices are not
          the places that sell the cheapest treadmill. A $200 machine you replace in two years, a
          $400 used one you have to rent a van to collect, and a $900 refurbished one with free
